{"annotationScore": 5.0, "comments": [{"commentType": "FUNCTION", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "22020326", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "28671670", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "28912033", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "Extracellular matrix protein (PubMed:22020326, PubMed:28671670, PubMed:28912033). Affects several essential steps in angiogenesis including endothelial cell proliferation, migration, and tube formation (PubMed:22020326, PubMed:28671670, PubMed:28912033). Positively regulates angiogenesis by acting as a ligand for CD93 receptor (PubMed:28671670, PubMed:28912033)"}]}, {"commentType": "SUBUNIT", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "11559704", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "22020326", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "28671670", "source": "PubMed"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "28912033", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "Heteromer of p110, p125, p140 and p200 subunits; disulfide-linked. Interacts with VEGFA. Interacts with CD93; this interaction promotes angiogenesis (PubMed:28671670, PubMed:28912033). Interacts with CD248 (PubMed:28671670)"}]}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-2623273", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q9H8L6"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "RHBDD2", "intActId": "EBI-17589229", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q6NTF9-3"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}]}, {"commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION", "subcellularLocations": [{"location": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "11559704", "source": "PubMed"}], "id": "SL-0111", "value": "Secreted, extracellular space, extracellular matrix"}}]}, {"commentType": "TISSUE SPECIFICITY", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "11559704", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "Endothelium"}]}, {"commentType": "PTM", "texts": [{"evidenc